### ****Edit Distance and Longest Common Subsequence****
If we do not consider the replace operation, then edit distance problem is same as the [Longest Common Subsequence](https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dsa/longest-common-subsequence-dp-4/) (LCS) problem. With only insert and delete operations allowed, the edit distance between two strings is ( M + N - 2* LCS)
